This directory stands in for a real easy-usfm build so that
`cargo build --features embedded-editor` compiles without one.

A build that reaches this file at run time is misconfigured: it was compiled to
carry the editor but nothing was carried. `editor::locate()` detects this file
by name and reports it.

To stage a real one, build easy-usfm (`npm run build` then
`cargo build --release -p easy-usfm-tauri`) and set BIBLECOMPOSE_EDITOR_BUNDLE
to a directory holding the result — on Windows that is the single
`easy-usfm-tauri.exe`; on macOS the `.app`, and on Linux the AppImage beside
whatever it needs.
